+- Only managers may freeze a project (org admins and non-managers get 403).
+  Freezing sets every member's role to `viewer`, managers included, and returns
+  the members after the change. A frozen project has no managers left, so it
+  cannot be unfrozen or frozen again through the API (managers get 403).
+  Nobody can change its tasks afterwards, while reads still work.
 - Archived projects reject all writes with 409 (reads still work).
 - A task ID that does not belong to the project in the path → 404.
 
